<Base title="About Calcloom" description="Calcloom offers free, fast and private online calculators for money, health and everyday dates.">
  <h1>About Calcloom</h1>
  <p>Calcloom is a growing collection of free online calculators in English and Arabic. Every tool runs in your browser, so the numbers you type are never sent to a server or stored.</p>
  <p>Results are estimates for general information. For financial or medical decisions, confirm with a qualified professional.</p>
